---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: Legion operator invokes initializePublishSaleResults()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_time: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_time --> q_revert_time: now < refundEndTime
    q_revert_time --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_time --> q_check_locked: now >= refundEndTime
    q_check_locked --> q_revert_locked: cancelLocked == true
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert AlreadyLocked
    q_check_locked --> q_lock: cancelLocked == false
    q_lock --> [*]: cancelLocked = true; emit ResultsInitialized()

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: Once cancelLocked is set, sale cannot be cancelled
        INV-002: Results initialization must occur after refund period
        INV-003: This step prevents race between cancellation and result publication
    end note
